<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63584" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐπῠρ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>, ἡ, for
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπο-πυρία</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a malignant intermittent fever</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Judic.</u>
				11
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπύριον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.51
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐπῠρ-ίας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <i>one who suffers from</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπυρία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(2).728
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18(2).121
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.399
			</span></i>:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειπῠρικός</span></b>  (leg. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐπῠρικός</span></b> ), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
				<i>like</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπυρία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				117
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐπῠριώδης</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, <i>of the nature of</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπυρία, πυρετός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			.</div>
